While the deities provide their clerics with the ability to cause great
afflictions upon their foes, to the deikhan they provide the ability to
resist many of these maladies so they may face down the most fearsome
clerical servants of their deities' enemies. It is known that some
protection is provided to the deikhan against fear, paralysis, charm,
summon, teleportation, disease, bleeding and even flame.

See Also: TELEPORT, SUMMON, DJALLA'S PROTECTION
